{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "38f3b27f24906ad9bbc8280d5f4ca6927c0af3ea579e514b501ac001f0ed1f20", "ja": "トゥインクル☆クランクイン！", "zh": "闪亮☆开镜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7159e8da87146c061e04337f7e71cd24bab2c993fb3da4c8a2d47642b5670711", "ja": "ついに撮影を始めるトゥインクルリズムに、\n監督からの無茶ブリが突きつけられる。\nだが「どんなお願いだって叶えてみせるのが\n魔法少女！」と挑戦する3人。\nそして撮影は、無事成功を収めるのだった。", "zh": "『闪亮节奏』终于开始拍摄，导演却\n提出了无理的要求。但是三人认为\n「魔法少女要能实现所有愿望！」\n于是勇于挑战。\n拍摄工作就这样顺利结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce6bc71027cdec54702dff1c2e5871fc631d43718b30fed940e2e784c555e3ed", "ja": "（いよいよ『トゥインクルリズム』がクランクイン。\n育たちに練習の成果を発揮してもらう時だ！）", "zh": "（『闪亮节奏』终于开镜了。\n该是育她们发挥练习成果的时候了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1001_kantoku", "source_sha256": "915a4b94a1983bbb2cb0c3a937ea278da536f89c24654ad76cb6f8d5cb88d95a", "ja": "765プロさん、ちょうどいい所に！\nちょうど相談したい事があったんですよ～。", "zh": "765艺能的先生，你来得正好！\n我刚好有件事情要找你商量～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0a84e596624578e99dc353248ee92a5120253803a9899917432ed0745121bd3b", "ja": "あっ、トゥインクルリズムの監督さん？\n何かありましたか？", "zh": "啊，是『闪亮节奏』的导演。\n请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1003_kantoku", "source_sha256": "7fdb3cfcd14d7a7befd81b1fcd95b7fd302b10be660d0895b5a729ae66b80978", "ja": "いや、ものは相談なんですがね？\n今の台本だとちょっと地味だと思ってまして……。", "zh": "其实，事情是这样的，\n我觉得目前的剧本有点太保守……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "a9d1eee3befe4c19083d6b2c441424ba14aae8c5dffd923af629423ee39ab1cb", "ja": "おはようございます、765プロの天海春香です♪\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "各位早安，我是765艺能的天海春香♪\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "4004e0bf36e0df8b81bfab3aea0e5c9c8076d08818bd3017e5891afc2b816927", "ja": "同じく765プロの菊地真です！\nよろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "同样隶属765艺能，在下是菊地真！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "70d3e2c54f1f11ed0dd2f2fdf199ee48a6ef8ecdf5f588bb30e28abfd8085ddb", "ja": "よかった。春香、真、来て早々に悪いけど、\nちょっといいか？", "zh": "太好了。春香、真，虽然你们才刚到，\n但可以听我说一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "5177bb456c3722e2d769a206dd028b5f31de019e311ca61c4c01b2de44b9c75b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nおはようございます……って、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n早安……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6e5b35eac617effebf9a726b6c98bb65014720910081653a4dec8878723c4e2", "ja": "ああ、監督の要望で、台本が変更になったんだ。\nアクションシーンを増やしたいそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，因应导演的要求，剧本更改了。\n他想要增加武打场面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "da8a39ddb1178d9d57f8993365346cdb4e5bfd472bc55a815ca9ad630a0ee83b", "ja": "なるほど……現場変更ってやつですね。\nでも、今のみんななら大丈夫かな。ね、春香？", "zh": "原来如此……就是现场临时更改吧。\n不过，现在的大家不会有问题的。对吧，春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "7b3ff56ac55c46b99992f0dd5ecb3ecd1511dffc5d791dfcd16a3f9fe8c6d822", "ja": "うん、平気だって思います。育ちゃんたち、もうすぐ\n衣装合わせから戻ってくるはず……あ、来た来たっ。", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得没问题。小育她们应该快试完装了……\n啊，来了来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "579c70e849f7b785a574134e2fda901afff5b4340baa6ab620a5fa90f9a47d38", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nむずかしそうな顔して、どうしたの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n你的脸色好凝重，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c3ad4b490d8d25bef6fa3b8ee2c47b13b45e1aabb4550c8600b844963f290c33", "ja": "ああ、実はな……。", "zh": "嗯，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "32ab62e7d8ba2432cfdf88c289b95ff71414962d401c2033449b1d21295033af", "ja": "と、いうわけなんだ。\nどうだ？　新しいアクションシーン、やれそうか？", "zh": "就是这样。\n怎么样？你们有办法应付新增的武打场面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "81216a3bea8e0d15800248bf099e07e61b5e8c8151950e62957a49cb04108499", "ja": "不安がないっていったら嘘になりますけど……でも！\nやります！　そうだよね、育ちゃん、亜利沙さん！", "zh": "要说不会担心是不可能的……不过！\n我们会试试的！对吧？小育、亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "37738489cbc16b77e8451b8a87117d8997ad99a143ee037413b36ac2bf3be6a5", "ja": "うんっ、へいきだよ！　桃子ちゃんもね、\nげんばでは予定がすぐかわるって言ってたんだ！", "zh": "嗯！没问题！桃子她也说过，\n在现场动不动就会变更预定计划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "04c477a96c33418250ecaf1ff809396a3b760a6ee2cd999f915bfe58c9b469c9", "ja": "ありさも賛成ですよ！　レッスンとは違う、育ちゃんと\n百合子ちゃんの新しいアクション……ムフフ♪", "zh": "亚利沙也赞成喔！可以看到练习时没有的\n小育和百合子的新动作……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0fed11777da51d9d5f38e8c24e0fc07fb2da0ad1c94d2d2b9688f67c109133dc", "ja": "わかってると思うけど、簡単なことじゃないぞ？　\n台本通りにやるのも、あんなに苦労したし。", "zh": "但我想你们心里应该都知道，新动作也不会很简单喔。\n别忘了你们辛苦努力那么久，才终于达到剧本的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "d4f842cb0e98efba08981b6c7fc7b4958d26855a3ddab7fd8a082ad91b7dffda", "ja": "大丈夫ですっ！\nだって私たちは……魔法少女、なんですから！", "zh": "没问题的！\n因为我们是……魔法少女啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "3349ad950cce1d9979959d1f3d5895d7292967ca590629b27d8c02297b0dc0fd", "ja": "そうですよ！　どんな願いも叶えちゃいます！\nアクションだってどーんとこいですよ♪", "zh": "没错！什么愿望都能实现！\n无论什么动作都尽管来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "856e69e4d9279dcb823baa7618454dc5f237ae36cb47ac7b0e938829e3c62711", "ja": "わたしたちは、魔法少女に変身しにきたの！　だから、\nどんなお願いだって叶えないとうそだもん！　ね？", "zh": "我们就是来变身成魔法少女的！所以，如果无法实现\n所有愿望，就不是真正的魔法少女了！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "c0c03907756bc6fdc116eedd0a2540873c5abc91a0907b14a2f4cf009c15479e", "ja": "と、いうことなんです！　それに、私たちには\n頼もしい先輩が二人もついててくれますし……。", "zh": "就是这样！而且，\n我们还有两位可靠的前辈帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "159e20099b629dde2217e34c13c6057191a2c43ac5a3c06e1a89d8ade1f10863", "ja": "そ、それに、{$P$}さんだって。\n怖いものなんか、ありません！", "zh": "再、再说了，还有{$P$}先生在。\n没有什么好怕的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "db3e086ff1adcd1111acc6aae5d620e3057c323f16786313523eb7f4f24eaf21", "ja": "よし！　魔法少女になったみんなを、\n俺も信じるよ。堂々と演技してこい！", "zh": "很好！我也很相信变成魔法少女的你们。\n抬头挺胸去演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3c63e369e86b326918ac942633a5766aef3ce761b0f25988eb6f34aea97b5ecf", "ja": "（こうして撮影は始まった。演技の変更には、\nやはり3人とも、苦労することになったが……）", "zh": "（拍摄就这样开始了。果不其然，\n演出的更动让她们三人有些吃力……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7985bb22539765fd45dabea127fe903211f58c1f3560ca0c80796dac4a5b8c27", "ja": "（しっかり最後まで演じ切り、撮影は終了した！）", "zh": "（但她们还是坚持演到最后，拍摄结束了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "e6d079b18da553b571d04bb96c3c6435aab22e7fcd7b881c4f2378c8ebf90219", "ja": "{$P$}さーんっ！\n撮影、全部終わりました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n全部都拍完了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7deea4997c591e5ec1c32be375a489979859e4575256a4460418334e9d62475b", "ja": "百合子、お疲れさま！　すごく良かったぞ。\n戦闘シーンもバッチリだったじゃないか！", "zh": "百合子，辛苦你了！你演得很棒喔。\n战斗场面也很完美耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "d75631f5051214904db22d624706d08598c4bb5a6fe5f0977ac155b2941dbdda", "ja": "はい、なんとか！　でも、足がガクガクしてます……。\nうう、しばらく図書館カフェに引きこもりたい……。", "zh": "是啊，我撑过去了！不过，现在脚还在发抖……\n呜呜，我想窝在图书馆咖啡厅里面一阵子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "135b8d870cad7585d26e82496a68cbfdc2f22c5b3640d7f3db10a6211179532e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nありさ、ちゃんとできてましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n亚利沙表现得还可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d44a327301f912c0f6b3d2fe229c3f7d3a6e3e13197f38954d31c40a9c46a444", "ja": "ああ、自然な演技ができていたな！\nアクションも連携が取れていたし、良かったぞ！", "zh": "很好啊，你的演技十分自然！\n武打动作也跟得上其他人，非常棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "f6148db13441f3b1bbb8b09cacff24598390aa0ba4d14ace9ade65f323334a16", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございますっ！　嬉しいのと\n恥ずかしいのとで、ありさ……爆発しそうですぅ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖！\n亚利沙又是开心又是害羞……快要爆炸了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "830e2735c088782856a7f0a045b7bf9258256f54b35832f559d945f21ebfbc97", "ja": "育も、お疲れ様。すごく頑張ってたな！\n大変だったろう？", "zh": "育，你也辛苦了。你付出很多努力喔！\n一定很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "c89ba5dda6ec9443edeb2f80caecd16f8c52d633bf0c3d5a1609445bdec9600b", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　だってわたしは、でんせつの\nトゥインクルプリンセスだもん。", "zh": "才不会呢！\n因为我是传说中的闪亮公主啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "95fa5ca353212b26ff876e2c6bc885797134f9dfab4b1ea9f3658168cb7e2aed", "ja": "さつえいくらい、ちゃんとできなくちゃ。\nちゃんと……できてたよね？", "zh": "不过只是录影，当然要好好完成啊。\n我应该……有做好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_1039", "source_sha256": "4622fae41e87da3a7c4ab83654d65bc334d089a11fa7d2ca758fe433767ef735", "ja": "頭をなでる", "zh": "摸头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3e278fd2c67d79f94fa22634c5a96ea1f3408ecc7ed69712720567b7c93ba0a6", "ja": "もちろん、ちゃんと出来てたぞ。\nさすが、立派な魔法少女だ！", "zh": "当然啰，你做得很好。\n你的确是个出色的魔法少女！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "345183c2e458707ea39eed4b1de66819df20802f59e2d1e6f71649336fc5eac9", "ja": "も、もう、頭はなでないでっ。\n子どもあつかいしないでね！", "zh": "真、真是的，不要摸人家头啦！\n别把我当小孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2002_p", "source_sha256": "6807a539002243a1b18e8de0ae119dc9c0194d91abcf68a638cf3faac927cb19", "ja": "おっと、ごめんごめん。\nでも本当にすごかったぞ。みんなも、春香も真もな！", "zh": "糟糕，抱歉抱歉。\n不过你真的很厉害喔。大家也一样，春香和真也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "6ce25d8ef0ccf56abb07c96445616aaf7adc6bb91e46d9648fe6e8bb917df00b", "ja": "へへっ、バッチリでしたね！\nみんな、レッスンの時以上の出来だったと思います！", "zh": "嘿嘿！很完美对吧！\n在下觉得大家的表现都比练习时还要优秀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2004_001har", "source_sha256": "eedf921b81fa48f8963c7936c33a73592b5a7cc90d51ffb09fdde36fb791872a", "ja": "大成功だね！　次はイベントライブがあるけど、\nこの調子で、成功させよう！", "zh": "真的非常成功喔！接下来还有活动演唱会，\n我们要保持下去，成功画下句点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2005_026yur", "source_sha256": "118bfaf2727c9c8d0b1e1a2a31df6e657d2e221cade310edf94400a517f22c4b", "ja": "ああっ！　ライブが残ってたんだ！　図書館カフェに\n引きこもってる場合じゃありませーんっ！", "zh": "我都忘了！还有演唱会！\n现在不是窝在图书馆咖啡厅的时候～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_05_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "2dfa6acbb869347b989d01362aca51c1f69987c0ddef71ff69b77f792cef2ece", "ja": "ふふふっ！", "zh": "呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
